# Tests

Maps: `test/README.md`, `test/components/README.md`, `test/mocks/README.md`.

- Run `pnpm dev:prepare` so `.nuxt/ui/*` exists. Aliases: `#build/*` → `.nuxt/`, `#imports` → `test/mocks/imports.ts`.
- Mount `src/runtime/components/<Pascal>.vue` directly. Do not load the Vite `ui()` plugin.
- Each spec covers default snapshot, variant classes, `ui` slot merge, slots, and `vitest-axe`.
- Assert semantic classes (`bg-primary`), not palette colors.
- Reset any `appConfig.ui` mutation before the test ends.
- `useHead` in the mock stays empty. Do not point `#imports` at `src/shims` or the Vue stub.
